# AssistX Release Signing Configuration Template
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL CREDENTIALS OR KEYSTORES TO SOURCE CONTROL.
#
# To configure release signing locally or in CI:
# 1. Copy this file or set the corresponding environment variables:
#    RELEASE_KEYSTORE_FILE=/path/to/your/release.keystore
#    RELEASE_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD=your_keystore_password
#    RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS=your_key_alias
#    RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD=your_key_password
#
# If these variables are not provided, './gradlew assembleRelease'
# automatically produces an unsigned release candidate APK:
#   app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release-unsigned.apk
#
# For manual signing with apksigner:
#   apksigner sign --ks release.keystore --out app-release-signed.apk app-release-unsigned.apk

